# Phase 17 raw card-art source pack (192 MB) — kept on disk for Stage 5 extraction,
# too large for git history. Downscaled @3x assets are added to the app target instead.
docs/solo_swiftui_asset_pack.zip

# Phase 18 gameplay recordings + source snapshot for the ChatGPT redesign review —
# review artifacts kept on disk (shared to ChatGPT), not in git history. The
# source zip is just a redundant snapshot of already-tracked .swift files. Prompts are tracked.
docs/video-ux-benchmarks/uno-mobile-gowild/redesign-review/*.mp4
docs/video-ux-benchmarks/uno-mobile-gowild/redesign-review/*.zip
